steps.description:
Review the proposal document (${proposal_link}) to understand the change and its rationale. Set up the workspace with a feature branch named after ${branch_slug}. Read and understand all files within scope (${scope_globs}). Implement the improvement strictly within scope — do not modify files outside the declared globs. Write clear, atomic commits explaining why each change was made.

Scope constraint: ${scope_globs}
Acceptance criteria: ${acceptance_criteria}

Output: list of files changed with a summary of each change.
